  "sourceTitle": "Vietnamese Smoothies",
  "sourceText": "Vietnamese Smoothies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, February 14, 2010 - 8:34am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nlrg ripe mango OR\nripe avocado OR\nsmall ripe papaya\ncup sweetened condensed milk\n2 cups ice\n1 tablespoon sugar or to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Peel and pit mango; cut into chunks. Pulse ingredients in blender or food processor until ice is pureed. Add sugar to taste. 2 This recipe yields 1 two-cup shake.",
